msgctxt "technologies.unlock_effects.name"
msgid "Allows outposts on coasts and islands without a road"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "technologies.flavor"
msgid "A road stops at the shore; a hull does not. The pilot reads the swell, the stars and the flight of shorebirds, and the island that no highway can reach takes its place in the same ledger as the inland farm. The monsoon sailors of the Indian Ocean, the island navigators of the Pacific and the coastwise skippers of the northern seas kept no single school: each taught the harbour master the same lesson — the sea is a road that needs no paving."
msgstr ""

